---
description: Engine process, voice loop, and local API
globs: kuro-rs/crates/kuro-engine/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Owns the voice turn loop, HUD hooks, and binding to `kuro-tools` execution.
Do not implement individual tools here; call into `kuro-tools` instead.
Hotkey capture stays in `kuro-hotkey`; the shell must not register a global hotkey.
Epoch dismiss and cancel flow through `kuro-core` epoch helpers.
API surface changes need matching tests in `kuro-engine/tests/`.
Keep `main.rs` thin; grow behavior in `lib.rs` modules with tests.
Panic boundaries stay at documented catch sites; do not add unguarded `unwrap` on I/O.
No new listeners off 127.0.0.1 without an ADR.